{
  "name": "蝶式建仓",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [721, 722, 723],
  "source": "蝶式建仓描述主力先温和吸筹，再在靠近60/120日均线的小平台上缩量整理，随后通过120线上小平台突破与放量长阳继续加仓；其最大特征是洗盘时股价不跌，甚至还能涨，后续若突破左右翅膀高点连线，则加速上涨可期。",
  "source_summary": "若股价在60/120日线附近形成不破位的小平台、5/10日线保持通气，随后向上突破平台高点，可视为蝶式建仓完成。",
  "comment": "当前先提取最可执行的日线近似版，重点表达‘靠近60/120线的强势缩量平台 + 通气 + 向上突破’。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["open", "close", "volume"],
  "warmup_bars": 150,
  "indicator_type": "breakout_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_fast_window": 5,
    "ma_mid_window": 10,
    "ma_support_window": 60,
    "ma_anchor_window": 120,
    "platform_lookback": 20,
    "volume_ma_window": 10,
    "platform_min_days": 3,
    "ventilation_ratio": 0.005,
    "signal_keep_days": 5
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_5",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_fast_window",
      "description": "5日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_10",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_mid_window",
      "description": "10日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_60",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_support_window",
      "description": "60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_120",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_anchor_window",
      "description": "120日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_gap",
      "op": "sub",
      "field": "ma_5",
      "field2": "ma_10",
      "window": 0,
      "description": "5日与10日均线距离"
    },
    {
      "id": "ventilation_threshold",
      "op": "mul",
      "field": "ma_10",
      "field2": "$params.ventilation_ratio",
      "window": 0,
      "description": "5/10日均线通气阈值"
    },
    {
      "id": "platform_high",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.platform_lookback",
      "description": "小平台最高收盘价近似"
    },
    {
      "id": "platform_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "platform_high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日小平台最高收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume_ma",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": "$params.volume_ma_window",
      "description": "成交量均线"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "breakout_platform",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "platform_high_prev",
      "description": "向上突破120线上小平台"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "before",
            "condition": {
              "op": "and",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "close",
                  "operator": ">=",
                  "right": "ma_10"
                },
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "close",
                  "operator": ">",
                  "right": "ma_60"
                },
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "close",
                  "operator": ">",
                  "right": "ma_120"
                },
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "ma_gap",
                  "operator": ">",
                  "right": "ventilation_threshold"
                },
                {
                  "op": "compare",
                  "left": "volume",
                  "operator": "<=",
                  "right": "volume_ma"
                }
              ]
            },
            "event": "breakout_platform",
            "window": "$params.platform_lookback",
            "min_count": "$params.platform_min_days"
          },
          {
            "op": "condition",
            "event": "breakout_platform"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "close",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "open"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "ma_60",
            "operator": ">=",
            "right": "ma_120"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算5、10、60、120日均线，并用5/10日均线距离近似原文中的‘通气’细节。",
    "在platform_lookback窗口内要求股价维持在10、60、120日线之上且量能缩至量均线附近，近似120线上小平台与洗盘不跌。",
    "当收盘价向上突破平台高点且当日收阳时，视为蝶式建仓右翅突破完成。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以收盘突破小平台高点并维持5/10日线通气的当日作为蝶式建仓确认日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文还要求A点后的OBV向上开口、2+3区间位置和B/E两高点速度线突破，当前版本未直接纳入。",
    "原文中的‘量芝麻点’和‘巨量收集筹码’被分别近似成缩量平台与突破收阳，后续可继续拆强弱版本。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= max(ma_anchor_window, platform_lookback, volume_ma_window) + 20。",
    "该规则是对原文几何图形与OBV语义的日线近似实现，应结合日志中的人工复核项使用。"
  ],
  "explain": "蝶式建仓被结构化为靠近60/120日线的强势缩量平台，配合5/10日线通气后向上突破。"
}
